Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:31.03,Label,,0,0,0,,PLANDOME  /  VICTORIAN ARCHITECTURE
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.41,Editorial,,0,0,0,,PLANNING A HOME EXTENSION\NOR PROPERTY TRANSFORMATION?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.41,0:00:08.85,Editorial,,0,0,0,,START WITH A CLEAR VIEW OF THE SITE,\NITS SURROUNDINGS,\NAND EVERY OPPORTUNITY FROM ABOVE.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.85,0:00:12.43,Editorial,,0,0,0,,FROM ELEGANT VICTORIAN STREETS\NTO AMBITIOUS MODERN UPGRADES,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.43,0:00:16.93,Editorial,,0,0,0,,PLANDOME TURNS COMPLEX PLANNING\NINTO A CONFIDENT PATH FORWARD.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.93,0:00:20.57,Editorial,,0,0,0,,OUR SPECIALISTS COMBINE LOCAL INSIGHT\NAND THOUGHTFUL DESIGN,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.57,0:00:25.50,Editorial,,0,0,0,,WITH PRACTICAL GUIDANCE\NTO MOVE YOUR PROJECT\NFROM FIRST IDEA TO APPROVAL.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.13,Editorial,,0,0,0,,BUILD WITH CLARITY.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.13,0:00:29.05,Editorial,,0,0,0,,BUILD WITH CONFIDENCE.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.05,0:00:31.03,Editorial,,0,0,0,,START YOUR PLANDOME JOURNEY TODAY.
